<TITLE>Rear Side Airbag Sensor</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>The rear side airbag sensors are mounted at the bottom of the C pillars.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The rear side airbag sensor at the bottom of the C pillar consists of a semiconductor type G sensor, a communication circuit, etc.; it detects an impact from the side and sends an ignition signal to the center airbag sensor (computer), which determines operation of the SRS curtain shield airbag.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
